#{[17592186401471 #edb/ref 1080 "The parabola ${x}^{2}=6(z-3)$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401471 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401471 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "86e5f373-6dc5-578d-9dab-a014632c2480" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401472 #edb/ref 1080 "The line $y=\\frac{3}{2}$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401472 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401472 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "017e8e93-5da0-5960-ba95-563c27bee3c1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401473 #edb/ref 1080 "The lines $y=-3$ and $y=15$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401473 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401473 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "defd7bf9-9f21-5237-ad4c-3feffa02e09e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401474 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186401475 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401474 #edb/ref 1069 "q-164401" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401474 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401474 #edb/ref 1071 "What is the trace in the $xz$-plane of the elliptic cylinder $\\frac{(x-4)^{2}}{8}+\\frac{(y-1)^{2}}{2}=1?$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401474 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "98ad452f-818a-5095-bf60-3f83ccbaae0f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401474 #edb/ref 1074 "To find the trace in the $xz$-plane, we substitute $y=0$ into the equation of the cylinder, and simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{(x-4)^{2}}{8}+\\frac{(0-1)^{2}}{2} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{(x-4)^{2}}{8}+\\frac{1}{2} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{(x-4)^{2}}{8} & =\\frac{1}{2} \\\\ (x-4)^{2} & =4 \\\\ x-4 & =\\pm 2 \\\\ x & =4\\pm 2 \\\\ x & =2,6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis gives us the equation of two lines $x=2$ and $x=6$ in the $xz$-plane." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401475 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401476 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401475 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401477 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401475 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401478 #edb/ref 1759218604