#edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401488 #edb/ref 1071 "What is the domain in the $xy$-plane of the hyperbolic cylinder $\\frac{{x}^{2}}{3}-\\frac{(y+1)^{2}}{4}=1?$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401488 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "57563ddb-cece-5702-b61c-95f3f8e1ba05" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401488 #edb/ref 1074 "The full expression describing all points on our hyperbolic cylinder is\n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{2}}{3}-\\frac{(y+1)^{2}}{4}=1,\\,z=k\n$$\n\nwhere $k\\in R$ can vary arbitrarily. \n\nThe domain of any cylinder in the $xy$-plane is its base curve. Hence, in this case, the domain is\n\n$$\n{(x,y)\\in {R}^{2}:\\text{ }\\frac{{x}^{2}}{3}-\\frac{(y+1)^{2}}{4}=1}.\n$$\n\nThis is a hyperbola centered at $(0,-1).$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401489 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401490 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401489 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401491 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401489 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401492 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401489 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401489 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186401494 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401489 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401489 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401489 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186401491 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401489 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "5199bacc-b680-59e5-9422-f0c044740659" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401490 #edb/ref 1080 "{R}^{2}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401490 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401490 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "9bf04dd9-c165-5182-ac9b-5676db24ff34" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401491 #edb/ref 1080 "A hyperbola centered at $(0,-1)$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401491 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186401491 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "c793d63c-12e4-5933-97de-c7ed09f6bb6c" #e